# 🧾 Cashier System — Laravel Web Application

![Laravel](https://img.shields.io/badge/Laravel-10.x-red)
![PHP](https://img.shields.io/badge/PHP-8.x-blue)
![License](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-Educational-green)

---

## 📌 Overview

**Cashier System** is a web-based application built using the Laravel framework to manage sales transactions, products, and reports efficiently.

This project is developed as part of a **portfolio and academic learning** to demonstrate backend development skills using Laravel and database integration.

The system simulates a real-world Point of Sale (POS) environment with a focus on simplicity, usability, and functionality.

---

## 🎯 Objectives

* To implement a CRUD-based system using Laravel
* To understand MVC architecture in real-world applications
* To build a functional cashier (POS) system
* To practice database design and transaction handling

---

## ✨ Key Features

### 🔐 Authentication System

* Secure login system
* Session-based authentication

### 📦 Product Management

* Add new products
* Edit product details
* Delete products
* View product list

### 🛒 Transaction System

* Add items to cart
* Calculate total price automatically
* Process sales transactions
* Store transaction history

### 📊 Reporting

* Display sales data
* Basic transaction reports

### 🎨 User Interface

* Clean and simple UI
* Responsive layout (basic)

---

## 🏗️ System Architecture

This project follows the **MVC (Model-View-Controller)** architecture:

* **Model:** Handles database logic (Eloquent ORM)
* **View:** Blade templates for UI
* **Controller:** Handles business logic and request flow

