## ⚙️ Installation & Setup Guide

Follow these steps to run the project locally:

### 1️⃣ Clone Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/AlitPranadita/kasir.git
cd kasir
```

### 2️⃣ Install Dependencies

```bash
composer install
npm install
```

### 3️⃣ Environment Setup

```bash
cp .env.example .env
php artisan key:generate
```

### 4️⃣ Configure Database

Edit `.env` file:

```env
DB_DATABASE=your_database
DB_USERNAME=root
DB_PASSWORD=
```

### 5️⃣ Run Migration

```bash
php artisan migrate
```

### 6️⃣ Run Application

```bash
php artisan serve
```

Access the app:

```
http://127.0.0.1:8000
```

